[dbasinge@silver.ucs.indiana.edu (d.michael basinger) writes:]
[] I have problem finding food to eat in Nethack 3.09. My charaacters
[] keep straving or be beat to death  while i'm unconisios, any hints.

avoid wearing fancy jewelry.  don't force teleports.  avoid excessive
digging a/o jumping.  eat monster corpses, being aware of poisonous
corpses until you're poison resistant and tainted ones.  the first
time that you get weak from hunger you can try prayer if you haven't
displeased your god or used your prayer foolishlessly.  search the first
four levels as quickly as possible using the rule 2*dlev <= explev (i.e.
try not to leave level 1 until you're level 2 experience and try not to
leave level 2 until you're level 4 experience and so on).  you may
encounter a shop with food items ...

